cff-version: 1.2.0
title: AISECA Tiered Control Framework
message: >-
  If you use this framework in research, reporting, or a security
  program, please cite it as below.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: AISECA — AI Security Alliance
    website: https://aiseca.org
    alias: AISECA
abstract: >-
  A practitioner-led, vendor-agnostic control framework for securing
  enterprise AI. 57 controls across 12 GenAI risk domains from NIST AI
  600-1, mapped to NIST AI RMF subcategories and MITRE ATLAS techniques.
  Each risk is addressed at three tiers: Define & Constrain (policy and
  boundaries), Enforce & Monitor (technical enforcement and detection),
  and Validate & Adapt (adversarial testing and continuous assurance).
keywords:
  - AI security
  - AI governance
  - security controls
  - NIST AI 600-1
  - NIST AI RMF
  - MITRE ATLAS
  - generative AI
  - agentic AI
  - risk management
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: https://github.com/aiseca/framework
url: https://aiseca.org/framework
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-07-28"
